{"name": "Off Gridders", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Off Gridders\u00a0is a student-made game created in around 40 days by <strong>ISART Digital students</strong> as part of their <strong>final-year project</strong>, giving them the opportunity to put their skills and learning into practice. We hope you enjoy the experience they have created for you!</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/af79a3ae1dccc40b066e50ec5d023f02.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"957\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for an explosive mix of parkour and competitive sports game, where two teams of three players face off in urban arenas. Run, jump, work together, and take control of the field in this fast-paced, intense multiplayer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras_big/ff4db46c9027253a97a18b145e56d179.avif?t=1784279102\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/ff4db46c9027253a97a18b145e56d179.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/e4458f7dd027306efaf2558b1a9b06ac.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"957\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dribble your opponents, combine powerful dashes with perfect passes, and impose your strategy to take the lead and claim victory. Make the field your playground and dominate the arena, your goal is simple: crush the opposing team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras_big/570718500947d00c109477705ac3411a.avif?t=1784279102\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/570718500947d00c109477705ac3411a.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/695ec3e3c81d7e5c40b56c9e34127a45.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"957\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As young rebels in a dystopian, near-future Britain, you must outrun a world of constant surveillance. The only freedom left is on the pitch. Join their playground chaos in this third-person high-energy sports game. Swing your bat and smash your way to glory in the industrial ruins of an abandoned shipyard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play dirty, play loud, play to win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras_big/91db9804fe1ced48825ef3ece141798f.avif?t=1784279102\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/91db9804fe1ced48825ef3ece141798f.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/b98a6a84419a6c0d5cdc76cd1801cfa1.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"957\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in an abandoned district that has been reclaimed by a group of young rebels and athletes to create a vibrant, colorful sports arena. The art style is semi-realistic and stylized, with exaggerated shapes and high-contrast colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras_big/c56431a3bbaa6ade6a9398181fe3dcfd.avif?t=1784279102\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/extras/c56431a3bbaa6ade6a9398181fe3dcfd.avif?t=1784279102\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Crush the competition in this fast-paced team sport where every second counts! Slide, run, catch the ball and face off the opposing team in an abandoned arena to score maximum points in high energy matches! This game was created by students from the video game school ISART Digital.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196140/3b5430349912a82838f4345008150189c466e2c2/header.jpg?t=1784279102", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Sports", "Action", "Team-Based", "Casual", "Multiplayer", "Online Co-Op"], "developers": "ISART DIGITAL", "publishers": "ISART DIGITAL", "release_date": "Jun 21, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4196140", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "22 June 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/K9wRE53lDt0", "first_seen": 1782079200.0, "review_rank": 377}